            "review_title": "Review at Sumo BBQ",
            "review_text": "FredericDanang\n3 contributions\n0\nWorst bbq restaurant in Danang\nDec 2019 • Family\nDont get fooled by the unlimited offer... They take so much time to serve its the first time i have to leave and still be hungry.(The restaurant was empty they take there time in purpose to not serve too much).Overpriced, the most expensive water bottle of Danang and paid napkins first time i see that. Meat is really fatty they serve you also only fat pieces and they always forget what you ordered. So many other bbq in Danang where the first water bottle and napkins are free. First and last time there. You can find better for half of the price and with better service too anywhere in Danang.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 7, 2019",
