            "review_text": "oscarpebbles\nBrisbane, Australia3446 contributions\n0\nWorst BBQ ever\nJan 2019 • Couples\nSo, once you get past the extremely disinterested staff be prepared to have the toughest meat you'll ever fing. This was so bad my teeth had to wrestle with the chucken and the chicken almost won. I've been to places similar to this where the staff explain how to eat the bbq and what sauces go with which meats but we eeren't even offered sauces. Truly a disgraceful meal which I will ensure I will never ever return to.\nThis is a Sumo sized failure.\nRead more\nWritten January 28, 2019",
