            "review_title": "Review at Sumo BBQ",
            "review_text": "Alanoki\nSouth Yarra, Australia9 contributions\n0\nBelow average.\nJan 2018 • Friends\nI came here for lunch in a group of 4.\n\nThe beef/chicken/seafood quality was all below average. The proteins didn’t hold the marinate at all and every cooked piece required sauce.\n\nAlso, when the staff changed the grill plate she took off the half cooked beef and put it straight on top of the raw chicken and vegetables. This was the worst part.\n\nSides were extremely bland.\n\nThe only saving grace was the ice-cream. They had a large selection.\nRead more\nWritten January 15, 2018",
